#~ "You will see all the beauty that Maui has to offer and can have a great "
#~ "time for the entire family. Tours are not too expensive and last from "
#~ "forty five minutes to over an hour. You can see places that are typically "
#~ "inaccessible with Maui helicopter tours. Places that are not available by "
